Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.22,0:00:05.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？會不會是這個…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.65,0:00:10.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,深夜 一口氣長成能生育的身體…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.15,0:00:12.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,魅魔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.27,0:00:30.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始 好香的味道
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.22,0:00:39.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.95,0:00:41.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早安的說！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼了呢 東雲先生
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.75,0:00:49.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個 做了個怪夢…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.75,0:00:54.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夢到一隻超大的山狼在聞我
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.65,0:00:57.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對了對了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.92,0:01:00.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,關於你拜託我調查的莉露的種族
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想 大概是魅魔
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.17,0:01:06.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,魅魔？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露 魅魔？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.30,0:01:11.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,魅魔是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是古代種的一種呢
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.90,0:01:14.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在這個世界啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.35,0:01:19.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有人類、獸人、精靈、矮人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:23.97,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（人類（聰明 體弱） 獸人（本能派 智力低）\N精靈（長壽 不擅爭鬥） 矮人（巧手 固執））
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.00,0:01:21.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這四種族分布著
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而在各族裡偶爾會有
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.60,0:01:28.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,像吸血鬼、狼人、蛇髮女妖、人魚這些
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.95,0:01:32.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,帶著太古種族特徵出生的人
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.92,0:01:35.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這些人就被稱作古代種
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之 就是很稀有的族裔啦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過 這孩子是魅魔嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.67,0:01:47.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也不能完全確定…
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.22,0:01:51.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最準的還是請魅魔本人來確認
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.07,0:01:58.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我倒是有個認識的 不過那傢伙啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.25,0:02:00.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,該怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:04.92,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（數日後）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.45,0:02:07.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這種鄉下地方
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.75,0:02:15.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,竟然有像姐姐這樣的美人啊
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.75,0:02:18.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,多少錢啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.57,0:03:59.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,多少錢啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:04:01.50,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第2話　莉露的才能）
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不夠呢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.07,0:04:02.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是銅幣吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,連買我半小時都不夠呢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.82,0:04:12.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你這傢伙 擺什麼高姿態啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.67,0:04:13.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看你的樣子…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.15,0:04:16.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你是個浪跡天涯的冒險者
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是這個村的人對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那又怎樣
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.85,0:04:27.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.60,0:04:31.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這村子裡已經有\N跟我做相同生意的人了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.10,0:04:35.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,外來的別來搶飯碗
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.02,0:04:39.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,話說 公會那邊應該跟你說明過了吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.52,0:04:46.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們獸人啊\N記性到底要多差才好呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.47,0:04:47.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這一路上
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.55,0:04:51.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你覺得我解釋給你這種人聽\N解釋了幾次啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,當椅子！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.17,0:04:59.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你總算回來了呢 始
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.95,0:05:08.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好久不見啊 薇洛妮卡
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.62,0:05:13.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這孩子就是信裡說的那個？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.30,0:05:15.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-嗯？\N-對
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.12,0:05:18.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥哥在做什麼啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.47,0:05:19.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,當椅子！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以看！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:20.65,0:05:23.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,奇怪？為什麼椅子會說話？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.82,0:05:26.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.32,0:05:28.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你叫莉露對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,借我看一下你的手好嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,手？好喔
Dialogue: 2,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好厲害 好厲害！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.00,0:05:43.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露變成漂亮的大女孩了！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.35,0:05:48.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她能跟我共鳴 沒錯 就是魅魔
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.45,0:05:50.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.35,0:05:54.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你好厲害喔姐姐！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不但能讓莉露變大
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好強… 而且超厲害的！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.82,0:06:02.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然莉露也是魅魔
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.62,0:06:05.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也能像姐姐這樣變強嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,像我這樣鍛鍊的話可以喔
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.07,0:06:10.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好厲害！為什麼要鍛鍊啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為男人痛到扭曲的臉
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.67,0:06:14.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我最愛了呀
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.85,0:06:20.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她還是一樣… 壞心眼的抖S！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,娜塔莉 上菜囉
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.47,0:06:23.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.35,0:06:25.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.92,0:06:27.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,特地讓你跑一趟真不好意思
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.15,0:06:32.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒關係呀？我自己也好奇
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是嗎？ 不過總不能白請你來
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.12,0:06:37.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,行情大概…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.20,0:06:39.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我都說不用啦
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.07,0:06:40.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.27,0:06:41.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,囉嗦！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.75,0:06:46.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉… 好吧！老實說
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為你這人很個性很差
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我不想欠你人情
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誰知道你以後會不會\N拿來威脅我 嗝！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.07,0:06:58.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拜託了 讓我用錢解決吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.65,0:07:06.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我偶爾也會 純粹出於善意…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這就免了！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.10,0:07:10.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之這頓我請！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.02,0:07:13.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,娜塔莉 來兩杯啤酒！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.12,0:07:14.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.32,0:07:15.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“啤酒”好喝嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.80,0:07:20.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這給小鬼喝太浪費啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.37,0:07:23.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想喝喝看嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.27,0:07:24.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吃肉去
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.00,0:07:26.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這麼早是誰啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:50.85,0:07:52.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早安 莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早安啊
Dialogue: 2,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什… 什麼事啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.00,0:08:04.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.42,0:08:10.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然昨晚也看到了\N但不愧是我的同族呀
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣的話
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.80,0:08:14.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大清早的有啥事？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.62,0:08:16.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂 始！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.55,0:08:21.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露借我一下好嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.25,0:08:28.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.92,0:08:32.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近店裡的姑娘接連不幹了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:32.05,0:08:34.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我在找新女孩呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結果這不就有個逸材嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.55,0:08:37.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還鮮嫩多汁呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不… 你說逸材也…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.67,0:08:43.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？她跟我一樣是魅魔耶？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.40,0:08:45.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,當然是逸材啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,美是種才能喔
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.20,0:08:51.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.85,0:08:57.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡 抱歉啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.67,0:09:01.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,打擾你們打情罵俏真不好意思啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才… 才沒有打情罵俏！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.62,0:09:06.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.87,0:09:08.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是那樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.62,0:09:13.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們看起來很要好呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感覺很在乎彼此呢…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？少開玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（少開玩笑了！）
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.82,0:09:21.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不對…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果我把莉露帶走
Dialogue: 2,0:09:25.77,0:09:28.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你就要自己一人當冒險者囉
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.07,0:09:30.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不會孤單到哭哭嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我才不會哭啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:34.70,0:09:35.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣工作效率還更高
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.97,0:09:38.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒她反而工作更順利！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.17,0:09:48.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:52.12,0:09:54.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你太好騙了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.37,0:09:59.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對不起嘛 你也知道我 …
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.07,0:10:01.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,個性就比較差呀
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.30,0:10:05.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再說 我真的想要她耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.77,0:10:13.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦 今天是回收光石
Dialogue: 2,0:10:13.90,0:10:15.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城也快重置了！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們要深入底層\N別走丟了 莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼了莉露 好沒精神呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:30.17,0:10:32.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為莉露… 是廢物…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊…不 那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這男人嘴巴真是壞呢
Dialogue: 2,0:10:39.27,0:10:40.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事的啦 莉露
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.02,0:10:43.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你才不是什麼廢物喔？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看起來是被欺負了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真令人羨慕！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.55,0:10:52.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,教教我秘訣嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,滾啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:56.12,0:10:57.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.40,0:10:59.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要開店也很辛苦的呀
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,然後呢 姐姐我跟你差不多年紀時呀…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡那傢伙…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是打算真的挖角莉露嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:06.32,0:11:09.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不… 算了 讓莉露自己選吧…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,反正跟我無關…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別踩那塊地板！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.95,0:11:20.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,傳送陷阱！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:22.42,0:11:23.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真沒辦法…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.45,0:11:29.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,搞砸了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:39.00,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 2,0:11:41.02,0:11:44.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行！完全沒反應 可惡！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.32,0:11:48.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我怎麼能在地下城慌張！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.37,0:11:50.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冷靜！首先…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個地下城還有魔物嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這地城地下有12層
Dialogue: 2,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,下層魔物還沒清完
Dialogue: 2,0:12:02.87,0:12:04.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是兩人被傳到最下層
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.15,0:12:07.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有就算是薇洛妮卡\N也覺得麻煩的魔物！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來如此 那我們往最下層去吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.25,0:12:12.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.66,0:12:17.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對了 他們要是被傳到上層\N就沒問題
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.57,0:12:21.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嘖… 這都還反應不過來…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過是身邊多了個小的\N就讓我亂了套…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.22,0:12:30.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 看來我是有點慌了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:30.55,0:12:31.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不會不會
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.62,0:12:33.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說起來 你叫什麼名字
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.47,0:12:37.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請叫我 “豬”！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:39.70,0:12:42.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊多謝了 豬
Dialogue: 2,0:12:48.17,0:12:51.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露… 你也是冒險者！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.55,0:12:53.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不管怎樣都要活下去！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:56.77,0:12:58.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都是是莉露把你捲進來
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.57,0:13:01.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姐姐你很危險 躲在我後面！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:01.70,0:13:03.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝啦
Dialogue: 2,0:13:03.85,0:13:07.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過 莉露沒到過這麼深的地方呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉 沒事
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這… 這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:18.10,0:13:21.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,像莉露這樣不熟悉這裡\N的確會怕嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行不行！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在地下城打鬧可是會死的！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉 我看錯了啦
Dialogue: 2,0:13:34.87,0:13:35.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真… 真是的！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.77,0:13:38.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姐姐你好膽小喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露不怕嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:40.92,0:13:42.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一… 一點都不怕！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:43.12,0:13:46.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉… 莉露是冒險者\N所以一點都不怕！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣呀 你很堅強呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.27,0:13:52.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,恐懼會讓身心都僵住！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是始教你的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.87,0:13:58.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你還挺有家長的樣子呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.25,0:14:02.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以冒險者就要忍著害怕冷靜判斷…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:08.10,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（身心都僵住的狀態）
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,強悍就是美麗！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.35,0:14:25.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姐… 姐姐好厲害！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.62,0:14:27.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,本小姐薇洛妮卡
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.17,0:14:29.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可不只是漂亮而已喲？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.77,0:14:35.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露剛剛沒有僵住吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才… 才沒有！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:38.12,0:14:40.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的啦！我才不怕！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露 聲音太大啦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露也做得到！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-看我的！\N-莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.15,0:14:51.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,糟了！我逗她逗過頭了！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說話不看對象和場合
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.22,0:14:56.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是我的壞習慣呀
Dialogue: 2,0:14:57.12,0:14:57.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露 大吵大鬧會招來更多魔物喔
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.97,0:15:10.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是好可怕…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你不是冒險者嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.55,0:15:16.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冒險者…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:25.52,0:15:27.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,出口在哪邊呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.97,0:15:33.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,左邊！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼 …
Dialogue: 2,0:15:37.90,0:15:39.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為什麼是左邊呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是因為…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.07,0:15:46.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為是莉露身為冒險者的… 直覺！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.85,0:15:49.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉… 莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.77,0:15:52.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,身為冒險者的直覺呀
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.15,0:15:54.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有意見嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.25,0:15:59.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你看著吧！前面一定…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有出口！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.35,0:16:10.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.10,0:16:15.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露的冒險者直覺 一點都不準！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:15.65,0:16:17.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且寶箱也被開過了！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,現在不是難過的時候！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.07,0:16:27.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露可是冒險者！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.77,0:16:33.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姐姐你躲在寶箱裡…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那莉露你呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露就…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把敵人引過去… 好痛！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.47,0:16:42.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你幹嘛啦？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要兩個人一起躲才對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是那樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.55,0:16:48.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把敵人引過去之後呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.85,0:16:52.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只犧牲自己是冒險者該做的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快點！躲起來！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:04.22,0:17:05.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的劍！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別管了 快進來！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:23.32,0:17:26.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來不怎麼聰明呢
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們應該能應付 莉露
Dialogue: 2,0:17:36.67,0:17:40.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露 你為什麼想當冒險者呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,老實說我覺得你不太適合喔
Dialogue: 2,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露還小
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.70,0:17:52.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也不知道自己適合什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.17,0:17:57.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過你跟我同族
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.95,0:18:01.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,學我這樣賺錢會更安全喔？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為美就是才能
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才能…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.50,0:18:12.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣工作效率還更高\N沒她反而工作更順利！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:14.50,0:18:16.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始說我礙事
Dialogue: 2,0:18:16.85,0:18:21.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是不是因為莉露沒有\N當冒險者的才能呢…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.70,0:18:29.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,獨眼巨人幼體嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:42.02,0:18:45.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我現在沒空陪你耗啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.12,0:18:54.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過 她們到底…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:59.92,0:19:02.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是… 莉露的劍！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.35,0:19:05.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那傻瓜跟魔物打了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在地下城遇到魔物…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,交戰 然後死
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.85,0:19:16.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人人都一樣 就算是莉露也是…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.47,0:19:21.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會這樣… 已經這樣了…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.77,0:19:26.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是… 冒險者常有的事…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:29.55,0:19:32.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很常見…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.75,0:19:42.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快點給我發現啊！遲鈍鬼！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:43.97,0:19:45.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:45.85,0:19:47.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:50.92,0:19:54.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉… 莉露才不會…\N為這點小事哭…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:55.72,0:19:58.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為莉露 是冒險者！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始 我們去回收光石吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.45,0:20:08.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不休息行嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒問題！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:11.02,0:20:13.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好 那就跟緊了喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:13.45,0:20:15.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說起來
Dialogue: 2,0:20:35.60,0:20:36.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,辛苦啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真好喝！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:44.22,0:20:45.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎樣？不吃嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.72,0:20:49.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呃… 那個啊… 始
Dialogue: 2,0:20:50.32,0:20:53.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露也許沒當冒險者的才能
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可能會給你添麻煩
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.72,0:20:57.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,囉嗦！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.90,0:21:07.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你的才能 就是傻呵呵地開懷大笑啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.60,0:21:10.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.90,0:21:12.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,趕緊吃飯啦
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.57,0:21:16.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真… 真是的！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.07,0:21:19.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說我傻呵呵的也太過分了啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:19.52,0:21:20.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你本來就不聰明
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.62,0:21:24.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,搞不好我也有冒險的才能啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.85,0:21:27.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 你看 飯快涼了
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.02,0:21:29.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！我開動了！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,被拒絕了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:21:32.05,0:21:32.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.79,0:21:35.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果說魅魔的才能
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.42,0:21:38.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是傻呵呵地開懷大笑
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.22,0:21:42.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那就算及格吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.97,0:21:45.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？什麼及格？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:45.82,0:21:49.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是你敢強逼我同族做下流事…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.10,0:21:55.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我就給你那玩意\N下個腐爛脫落的詛咒吧
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.05,0:21:58.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別… 別鬧了薇洛妮卡！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那樣我就當作是開戰了！
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.67,0:22:02.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥！要打仗嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那莉露要上啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.15,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（下回 莉露與安揚戈）
